# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. They run inside Alpine containers
# (docker-entrypoint.sh is the image's ENTRYPOINT), where a CRLF shebang makes
# the kernel fail with "no such file or directory" and the container never
# starts. Windows checkouts default to CRLF here (core.autocrlf=true), so this
# is pinned rather than left to local git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
